#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/usb-qubes.rst:185
#: 2d8511d0d2a94bebab621a1dd0743af1
msgid ""
"**If you use a USB keyboard**, hiding your USB controllers from dom0 could "
"lock you out of your system. See :ref:`user/advanced-topics/usb-qubes:usb "
"keyboards` for more information."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/usb-qubes.rst:187
